 SG_ DTC : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] ""  CLUSTER
 SG_ Temp : 56|8@1+ (1,-20) [-20|235] "degC"  CLUSTER
 SG_ SOC : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|100] "%"  CLUSTER
 SG_ DClinkVoltage : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|80] "V"  CLUSTER
 SG_ DriveMode : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|3] ""  CLUSTER
 SG_ Speed : 0|8@1+ (1,-10) [-10|245] "km/h"  CLUSTER



